    <panel_attributes>title=SD07 Update Application Status (State pattern) and Undo (F13 / UC11)
obj=Student~Student ACTOR
obj=:ApplicationTrackerPage~ATP
obj=:ApplicationAPI~AAPI
obj=:ApplicationService~AS
obj=:ApplicationRepository~AR
obj=:Application~APP
obj=:ApplicationState~ST
obj=:StatusChange~SC CREATED_LATER
obj=:DomainEventBus~BUS
obj=:MemoryRecorder~MR
obj=:MemoryManager~MM
obj=:NotificationService~NS

Student-&gt;&gt;&gt;ATP : 1: changeStatus(applicationId,\n"submit")
ATP-&gt;&gt;&gt;AAPI : 2: transition(req, applicationId); on=AAPI
AAPI-&gt;&gt;&gt;AS : 3: transition(userId, applicationId,\n"submit", USER, null); on=AS
AS-&gt;&gt;&gt;AR : 4: findById(applicationId, userId); on=AR
AR.&gt;AS : 5: app (or NotFound -&gt; 404\; other\nusers' data is never visible); off=AR
AS-&gt;&gt;&gt;APP : 6: submit(); on=APP
APP-&gt;&gt;&gt;ST : 7: submit(app); on=ST
combinedFragment=alt~f1 ATP NS; AAPI:[current state is SavedState or\nPreparedState]
ST-&gt;&gt;&gt;APP : 8: setState(s)
text=ST:s = new AppliedState()
ST.&gt;APP : 9: ok; off=ST
APP.&gt;AS : 10: ok; off=APP
AS-&gt;&gt;&gt;AR : 11: save(app)
AS-&gt;&gt;&gt;SC : 12: &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt; (from PREPARED to APPLIED, source\nUSER)
AS-&gt;&gt;&gt;AR : 13: saveChange(change)
AS-&gt;&gt;&gt;BUS : 14: publish(ApplicationStatusChanged)
BUS-&gt;&gt;&gt;MR : 15: handle(event)
MR-&gt;&gt;&gt;MM : 16: remember(userId, EPISODIC,\n"applied: Backend Intern @ Acme\n(YORK, score 78)", applicationId)
BUS-&gt;&gt;&gt;NS : 17: handle(event)
AS.&gt;AAPI : 18: StatusChange; off=AS
AAPI.&gt;ATP : 19: 200 OK (new state +\nallowedActions()); off=AAPI
..=f1; AAPI:[any other state (e.g.\nRejectedState)]
ST.&gt;APP : 20: InvalidTransitionError
APP.&gt;AS : 21: InvalidTransitionError
AS.&gt;AAPI : 22: InvalidTransitionError
AAPI.&gt;ATP : 23: 409 Conflict +\napp.allowedActions()
--=f1
text=Student:--- undo the most recent change\n---
Student-&gt;&gt;&gt;ATP : 24: undoChange(changeId)
ATP-&gt;&gt;&gt;AAPI : 25: undoTransition(req, changeId); on=AAPI
AAPI-&gt;&gt;&gt;AS : 26: undoTransition(userId, changeId); on=AS
AS-&gt;&gt;&gt;AR : 27: findChange(changeId, userId); on=AR
AR.&gt;AS : 28: change; off=AR
combinedFragment=alt~f2 ATP BUS; AAPI:[change is not the latest for this\napplication]
AS.&gt;AAPI : 29: 409 Conflict (undo newer changes\nfirst)
..=f2; AAPI:[latest change]
AS-&gt;&gt;&gt;SC : 30: revert()
AS-&gt;&gt;&gt;APP : 31: setState(s)
text=APP:s = state named change.fromState\;\nrestoration is audited, not a\nnormal transition
AS-&gt;&gt;&gt;AR : 32: save(app)
AS-&gt;&gt;&gt;AR : 33: saveChange(change)
AS-&gt;&gt;&gt;BUS : 34: publish(ApplicationStatusChanged)
AS.&gt;AAPI : 35: app; off=AS
AAPI.&gt;ATP : 36: 200 OK; off=AAPI
--=f2
</panel_attributes>
